# Input

```svelte
{#each arr as {  a,b =''}}
    {a}
    {b}
{/each}

{#await promise then {  a,b =''}}
    {a}
    {b}
{/await}

{#await promise}
    Loading
{:then {  a,b =''}}
    {a}
    {b}
{/await}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,16 +1,16 @@
-{#each arr as { a, b = '' }}
+{#each arr as {  a,b =''}}
     {a}
     {b}
 {/each}
 
-{#await promise then { a, b = '' }}
+{#await promise then {  a,b =''}}
     {a}
     {b}
 {/await}
 
 {#await promise}
     Loading
-{:then { a, b = '' }}
+{:then {  a,b =''}}
     {a}
     {b}
 {/await}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#each arr as {  a,b =''}}
    {a}
    {b}
{/each}

{#await promise then {  a,b =''}}
